			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 715010101,
					"content": "嗯…這兩天情況在愈發惡化，勘探隊的行動也會受限。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010102,
					"content": "有誰能解決這樣的委託呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010103,
						715010104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010103,
					"content": "怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010105,
					"content": "#啊，是{NICKNAME}和派蒙，真是來得正好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010106,
					"content": "來得正好？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010107,
					"content": "聽上去又有發生了什麼麻煩事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010108,
					"content": "這段時間，不知道為什麼，層岩巨淵的礦洞和礦道突然湧出了大量的黑色泥狀物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010109,
					"content": "因為是突發情況，勘探隊也沒法立刻做出應對，調查進度也一停再停，海迪夫也向冒險家協會委託尋找協助者…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010110,
					"content": "啊？黑色泥狀物，難道是層岩巨淵下面那種…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010111,
					"content": "對，就是那類黑泥，不知道為什麼湧到了礦洞和礦道那邊，勘探隊調查進程受阻不說，就連日常的行動都要受到影響…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010112,
					"content": "畢竟大量資源和材料都得倚靠礦道進行運輸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010113,
					"content": "這樣多久了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010114,
					"content": "有一段時間了，雖然海迪夫說他找到了願意幫忙的須彌學者，但是那名學者也需要協助…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010115,
					"content": "我正為有誰能解決這件事而頭疼呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010116,
					"content": "海迪夫的委託，酬勞應該很多吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010117,
					"content": "沒有人願意去嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010118,
					"content": "畢竟那些黑色的泥狀物還是很危險的…沒有人願意接這份委託啊。雖然因為酬金來的人很多…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010119,
					"content": "但許多冒險家一聽到是在層岩巨淵，就打起了退堂鼓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010120,
					"content": "而且，大部分冒險家對於層岩巨淵下的環境也並不熟悉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010121,
					"content": "能夠接受這項委託的，應該是既不害怕危險，又對層岩巨淵環境十分瞭解的人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010122,
					"content": "#我正煩惱如何找到可以擔當此任的人，{F#妳}{M#你}們就路過了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010123,
					"content": "#原來是這樣，{NICKNAME}，看上去情況真的很危急呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010124,
						715010125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010124,
					"content": "嗯，得去看看才行…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010126,
					"content": "那我們現在就去層岩巨淵找海迪夫吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010127,
					"content": "#啊，關於這點…海迪夫說{F#妳}{M#你}直接去找那位須彌學者就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010128,
					"content": "他的原句是這樣說的：「如果有願意來的人，就讓他去層岩巨淵的營地前吧，那傢伙一直在那邊調整設備呢。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010129,
					"content": "好，我們馬上就去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010130
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010130,
					"content": "#嗯，層岩巨淵的安全，就交給{F#妳}{M#你}們了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "凱瑟琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 715010125,
					"content": "就當幫海迪夫一次吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715010104,
					"content": "發生什麼事了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715010105
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7150102,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7150102
			],
